{"id": "97110103", "name": "נגזרת של e^(ax) או ln(ax) – מקדם שלם, שלילי או שברי", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><div style=\"font-weight:bold;color:#4b1f6f;margin-bottom:6px\">הנתונים</div><p>מצאו את הנגזרת של הפונקציה</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f(x)={{CT:0}} \\]</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\( f'(x)= \\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p class=\"input-hint\" dir=\"rtl\" style=\"font-size:0.88em;color:#555;margin:6px 0 0;text-align:right\">איך מזינים: את \\(e^{u}\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">exp(u)</code>, את \\(\\ln u\\) מזינים <code dir=\"ltr\">ln(u)</code> (או <code dir=\"ltr\">log(u)</code>), וכפל מסמנים בכוכבית.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">מבנה הפתרון:</b> [[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]הפונקציה היא קבוע כפול <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(e^{u}\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:1}}\\)</span>. גוזרים לפי כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(e^{u}\\right)'=e^{u}\\cdot u'\\)</span>.[[else]]הפונקציה היא קבוע כפול <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln u\\)</span> עם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:2}}\\)</span>. גוזרים לפי כלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\ln u\\right)'=\\frac{u'}{u}\\)</span>, או מפרקים קודם לפי חוקי הלוגריתמים.[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 1 — הנגזרת של הפונקציה הפנימית</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:1}}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'={{CT:3}}\\)</span>.[[else]]<span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:2}}\\)</span>, ולכן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u'={{CT:4}}\\)</span>.[[/if]]</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">שלב 2 — כלל השרשרת</b><br>[[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]]הקבוע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span> נשאר כגורם:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)={{CT:6}}\\cdot\\left({{CT:3}}\\right)={{CT:7}} \\]</p>[[else]]הקבוע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:5}}\\)</span> נשאר כגורם:<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ f'(x)={{CT:5}}\\cdot\\frac{ {{CT:4}} }{ {{CT:2}} }={{CT:7}} \\]</p>המקדם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\({{CT:4}}\\)</span> מצטמצם. אותה תוצאה מתקבלת מחוק הלוגריתמים: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln\\left({{CT:2}}\\right)=\\ln {{CT:4}}+\\ln x\\)</span>, והנגזרת של הקבוע <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\ln {{CT:4}}\\)</span> היא 0.[[/if]]</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 30, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "ta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "b*exp(ae*x)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">חסר גורם מכלל השרשרת: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(e^{u}\\right)'=e^{u}\\cdot u'\\)</span>, וכאן <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:1}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 2, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 2, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "b*al/x", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-3-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">שימו לב: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\ln u\\right)'=\\frac{u'}{u}\\)</span>. גם <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u\\)</span> במכנה כולל את המקדם, והוא מצטמצם.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 3, "answernote": "prt1-3-F", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 3, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "b/(al*x)", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">שימו לב: <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(\\left(\\ln u\\right)'=\\frac{u'}{u}\\)</span>, ובמונה יש את הנגזרת של <span dir=\"ltr\">\\(u={{CT:2}}\\)</span>.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-4-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["ae", "al", "b", "kd", "p", "ta"], "nvariants": 50}